{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">《死有對証》昨日（5日）晚播出一集，劇情講述骸骨死者的身分被確認為詹柏宇（阮浩棕飾）的父親，從而揭開一段沉痛過往。原來柏宇自小飽受家暴兼爛賭的父親摧殘，一直與母親馮瑜（韓馬利飾）相依為命；然而命運弄人，馮瑜不幸患上癌症，命在旦夕。</span></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"acb789ef-1b8d-4300-9fb6-d463540589d0.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026EunwynM4vW1791259327.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"acb789ef-1b8d-4300-9fb6-d463540589d0.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">劇中柏宇對患癌母親照顧得無微不至，陪睇醫生之餘，更嚴格管控母親飲食，禁止她食垃圾食物。最搞笑是柏宇竟然親暱地稱呼媽媽為「BB」，搞到 Mary 姐都忍不住吐槽：「你唔好咁長氣，嗌住阿媽好唔好！」雖然嘴上嫌棄，但馮瑜其實十分疼愛兒子，一直珍藏柏宇從小到大的獎狀，母子情深絕對會讓觀眾眼濕濕。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"c9968d23-6c74-4c8a-8777-b6b10329f85c.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026Wl3ECae9SB1791259326.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"c9968d23-6c74-4c8a-8777-b6b10329f85c.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">談到今次與前輩韓馬利結母子緣，阮浩棕接受tvb.com獨家訪問時對 Mary 姐讚不絕口：「Mary 姐真係一個好厲害嘅前輩，大家合作感覺好好，成個過程好舒服，真係好鍾意 Mary 姐！」被封為「TVB御用媽媽」的韓馬利，私下更為阮浩棕打了一支極大的強心針，阮浩棕笑言：「Mary 姐私下同我講過：『做親佢仔女都紅㗎！』跟住叫我加油，對我係一個好大嘅鼓勵同鼓舞！」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">對於劇中狂嗌 Mary 姐做「BB」，阮浩棕笑指是劇本特意設定來誤導觀眾，但卻無意中拉近了兩人距離：「叫下叫下，感覺同 Mary 姐嘅關係更加親切緊密！」他坦言 Mary 姐的親和力極高，令他經常自然流露真感情：「我扶住佢行嘅時候，會輕輕搓下佢手臂，自己都忍唔住，真係好似我媽媽咁。」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3906179c-7eb6-4928-ace0-594c6590ff64.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/20261HQX8DOQ8f1791259326.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3906179c-7eb6-4928-ace0-594c6590ff64.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"fb7ebb74-5774-4321-a975-8a754287b113.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026RX2WaDCBwo1791259326.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"fb7ebb74-5774-4321-a975-8a754287b113.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">至於現實中會否叫自己母親做「BB」？阮浩棕就直言沒有這個習慣，但卻自爆與真媽媽有一個極度特別的「默契儀式」：「每朝起身我哋一見面，都會有一個好奇怪嘅笑容，又或者臨瞓之前我對佢咁笑，佢都會咁樣回應我，係我同媽媽之間嘅一個專屬小儀式！」</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-06T04:39:08.418629+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":703,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}